### MusicStreamer API – Exemplos de Requisições
### Base URL: https://localhost:7001

### ─── AUTH ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Registrar usuário
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "João Silva",
    "email": "joao@teste.com",
    "password": "Senha@123"
}

###

### 2. Login (admin)
# @name login
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@musicstreamer.com",
    "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

### 3. Perfil do usuário autenticado
GET https://localhost:7001/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### ─── BANDAS ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4. Listar todas as bandas
GET https://localhost:7001/api/bands

###

### 5. Buscar banda por ID
GET https://localhost:7001/api/bands/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101

###

### 6. Buscar bandas por termo
GET https://localhost:7001/api/bands/search?term=metal&page=1&pageSize=10

###

### 7. Criar banda (requer Admin)
POST https://localhost:7001/api/bands
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Led Zeppelin",
    "description": "Banda britânica de rock formada em 1968."
}

###

### 8. Atualizar banda
PUT https://localhost:7001/api/bands/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Metallica",
    "description": "Descrição atualizada da banda."
}

###

### ─── ÁLBUNS ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### 9. Listar álbuns
GET https://localhost:7001/api/albums

###

### 10. Criar álbum
POST https://localhost:7001/api/albums
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Master of Puppets",
    "releaseYear": 1986,
    "bandId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101"
}

###

### ─── MÚSICAS ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### 11. Listar músicas
GET https://localhost:7001/api/musics

###

### 12. Buscar músicas
GET https://localhost:7001/api/musics/search?term=enter&page=1&pageSize=5

###

### 13. Criar música
POST https://localhost:7001/api/musics
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Master of Puppets",
    "durationInSeconds": 515,
    "albumId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201"
}

###

### ─── BUSCA GLOBAL ────────────────────────────────────────

### 14. Busca global
GET https://localhost:7001/api/search?term=nirvana&page=1&pageSize=10

###

### ─── PLANOS ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### 15. Listar planos
GET https://localhost:7001/api/subscription-plans

###

### 16. Assinar plano (Premium)
POST https://localhost:7001/api/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "planId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
}

###

### 17. Assinatura atual
GET https://localhost:7001/api/subscriptions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### ─── TRANSAÇÕES ──────────────────────────────────────────

### 18. Autorizar transação
POST https://localhost:7001/api/transactions/authorize
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "merchant": "Spotify Premium",
    "amount": 19.90,
    "requestedAt": "2025-06-01T10:00:00Z"
}

###

### 19. Listar transações
GET https://localhost:7001/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### ─── PLAYLISTS ───────────────────────────────────────────

### 20. Criar playlist
# @name createPlaylist
POST https://localhost:7001/api/playlists
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Minha Playlist Rock"
}

###

### 21. Listar playlists
GET https://localhost:7001/api/playlists
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 22. Adicionar música à playlist
POST https://localhost:7001/api/playlists/{{createPlaylist.response.body.$.id}}/musics/00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### ─── FAVORITOS ───────────────────────────────────────────

### 23. Favoritar música
POST https://localhost:7001/api/favorites/musics/00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 24. Listar músicas favoritas
GET https://localhost:7001/api/favorites/musics
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 25. Favoritar banda
POST https://localhost:7001/api/favorites/bands/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 26. Listar bandas favoritas
GET https://localhost:7001/api/favorites/bands
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###
